          "text": "Témoignages: SAINT-GEORGES-DE-POINTINDOUX (85) 20.08.2014",
          "text_sha256": "e5085ef8d10c539e8a28e1dc5a1c4660d6af527b609ba394caa2b6423f0770d0"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
